THANKS
======

This project depends on the following open-source projects:

  Dhizuku-API (MIT) — provides the Device Owner API
    https://github.com/iamr0s/Dhizuku-API

  AndroidHiddenApiBypass (Apache 2.0) — bypasses Android hidden API restrictions
    https://github.com/LSPosed/AndroidHiddenApiBypass

  AndroidX Core (Apache 2.0) — provides BundleCompat and other compat utilities
    https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/core


Reference implementations:

  OwnDroid (GPL-3.0) — the DevicePolicyManager binder wrapping approach
  is based on this project
    https://github.com/BinTianqi/OwnDroid


Development tools:

  CodeAssist (GPL-3.0) — IDE used for on-device development
    https://github.com/tyron12233/CodeAssist


Other:

  Dhizuku (GPL-3.0) — the host environment this project serves
    https://github.com/iamr0s/Dhizuku


Thanks to all authors and community contributors.
